      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e67d94db08157b89307f447f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所谓的RKST评分是每年七月时公布的\n针对出道前赛马娘的评价分数。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36926f352c8759d46741ade544711b4524cae05382ae5c9b282651f7ca78ab16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96be022255c28cb16cd525ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是由引退的训练员和赛马娘评论家等人士，\n针对赛马娘的能力进行分析，\n将综合评价数值化的评分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb944edb39fe04a2490f6c9b899c73683bed62d0a7069ccc78b58cfd6cac1d9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:188f1de4e46f92670fa9db38",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻获得了两亿三千万分，\n是评分纪录史上压倒性的高分。\n因此，在出道前就倍受瞩目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07154761360848998b8568754d29f5161a18e904a48d2717c7c276261704839d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67260ff17b42972939effd10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9001c462cda02e04688042965b70cf8db0bfc021e262b0efa9c3c3adc791b7da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
