      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "明天就是期待已久的皋月赏了。\n然而天气预报的却不太乐观。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e68063dad1c33f944159af74646cb2c57ddf3687370652ba5b5060365cdac13e",
