    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2023473aafb55594ab22b8b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然步调被稍微打乱了……\n但我反而因为这样变得更冷静了的样子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69be0e6366b55374c60053e777a9bb68f0c240e44574613e08d9db8778e6e90f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d8be67e20cca4f23e774064",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻露出了微笑。\n她精神层面的强韧又再次让我感到惊讶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43e95f7e482f5ac3220431197b17eedcfaba7614e916a9471459e00e11dfe28a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15c9e4ebaebd4ba15d41ed40",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻",
      "source_fingerprint": "a913b033e75912b0a4cb7963f7e72669b709a7ceab5f45934f12e6bb61efe713",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2376ff9b9254cc6da73e9a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠的第一冠……\n我绝对不能输！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "529cbcc07f19323218b7785849c5570f606fca6f1e423dcdc914318d7f848de4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0ece1e2c5d2fb799d58bb5d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许是和她的干劲互相呼应吧。\n厚重的雨云在不知不觉间散去，\n耀眼的阳光回到了场上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0067a5cc2aab200b32995194ead36843aa2ba8866e294e1112517088f0127f38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca68df9333a775a4de414446",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "隔天早上──雨并没有预期中的大，\n但确实吹着不间断的强风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b95f2d3122b2c9b5a009f81e9c5e391dcd2782bd2ebf18154688c715b35fd52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6ca5ffba1a2fecaf9dc4e2f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "感觉电车很有可能因为强风而停驶。\n于是，我决定搭乘\n出租车前往中山赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97e6f8f2fcfedbd26f005327db9b25dd37d669c4e7f49d0e26a11433d233e876",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e81c70b703e0e25abc9534e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，高速公路也受到天气的影响而拥塞。\n连到了预定抵达赛场的时间，\n也还尚未脱离高速公路──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8500658248774cb9419f2687f6c5874426ca86de02aaa97401ec17e959aaf163",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15d164e8a41c0e0b52a6cddd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只能下车用跑的去赛场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "354dca7e6954c38a5c6460fdc696192b34b376f7922f89edf1a2a36cdce41b7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067201.json",
      "json_path": [
