    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:192940dce7f600f0fd87f5db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "强风大到差点把里见光钻给吹倒。\n算是这个时期罕见的春季暴风雨。没有想到\n居然会因为天气而被困在半路上，并差点迟到──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6901b51af578867955c7f9d39f9816fd20edaaea501f51220d224a807cc726d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067201.json",
